  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Once per day a freemind can use their stored kashoom energy to “slip” as a free action, an ability that lets them go partially out of phase with our reality. This functions like an ethereal jaunt spell but lasts for only 1 round.</p>\n<p>At each odd level after 1st, they can turn ethereal for an additional round (for a maximum of 10 rounds at 19th level), though these rounds need not be consecutive. The total number of rounds they may slip for per day is renewed after resting for 8 hours.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/freemind#toc2\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
